{"from": "text:josephus-ant-17-death", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-04-12-john-arrested", "note": "Josephus's account of Herod's death and the division of his kingdom (Ant. 17) is the frame for Antipas's tetrarchy of Galilee and Perea, under which John was arrested and executed at Machaerus; chapter 04's Machaerus edges record that the fortress passed to Antipas on Herod's death."}
